    "metric": {
      "description_paragraphs": [
        "Define $\\Delta_i(x)=\\mu^i(x^*)-\\mu^i(x)$ and signed coordinate regret $R_i(T)=\\sum_{t=1}^T\\Delta_i(X_t)$. The simultaneous expected criterion is $\\max_{i\\le2}\\mathbb E R_i(T)$. The secondary regret can be negative, so the maximum is taken after each expectation.",
        "For the high-probability view, use $R_i^+(T)=\\sum_t[\\Delta_i(X_t)]_+$ and the common threshold for $\\max_iR_i^+(T)$. This is a distinct metric linked to its explicit view."
      ],
      "base_expression": "Define $\\Delta_i(x)=\\mu^i(x^*)-\\mu^i(x)$ and signed coordinate regret $R_i(T)=\\sum_{t=1}^T\\Delta_i(X_t)$. The simultaneous expected criterion is $\\max_{i\\le2}\\mathbb E R_i(T)$. The secondary regret can be negative, so the maximum is taken after each expectation. For the high-probability view, use $R_i^+(T)=\\sum_t[\\Delta_i(X_t)]_+$ and the common threshold for $\\max_iR_i^+(T)$. This is a distinct metric linked to its explicit view.",
      "criterion": "signed_coordinate_regret"
    },
    "resource": {
